flowchart TD
    Start([Uninstall]) --> Lock[Acquire]
    Lock --> Recover[Recover shared journal]
    Recover --> Refresh[RefreshInstalled]
    Refresh --> Manifest[Config List + local resolve]
    Manifest -->|no record| WarnNone[Warn + Agent-only unexecuted]
    Manifest -->|record| Type{Power type}
    Type -->|Skill| Skill[ResolveSkill + filesystem Uninstall]
    Skill --> FSJournal[schema v1 filesystem removing/committing/rolling-back]
    Type -->|MCP| MCP[ResolveMCP + Agent CLI Inspect]
    MCP -->|present| Def[Cloud GetMCP exact manifest version]
    Def --> MCPTx[UninstallMCP with definition]
    MCP -->|absent| MCPStale[UninstallMCP with nil definition]
    MCPTx --> CLIJournal[schema v1 agent-cli removing/committing/rolling-back]
    MCPStale --> Missing[remove only matching MCP manifest entry]
    FSJournal --> Result{TargetMissing? / error?}
    CLIJournal --> Result
    Missing --> Result
    Result -->|missing| WarnMissing[lock-held target-missing Warn]
    Result -->|error| Fail[full-ref failed + fail-fast]
    Result -->|success| Done[full-ref completed]
    WarnMissing -->|error| Fail
    WarnMissing -->|success| Done
    WarnNone --> Next{next Agent}
    Done --> Next
    Next -->|yes| Manifest
    Next -->|no| Release[Release then render]
    Fail --> Release
